{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an image-only model using ResNet50 with single-profile input, isolating the effect of image modality. Validation accuracy of 0.2079 and F1 of 0.1718 are lower than RNA-only (0.4849) and multimodal baselines, suggesting image data alone may not contribute meaningfully. However, the absence of direct comparisons to other image-only configurations leaves uncertainty about the modality's standalone utility."
}

